  /**
   * Counted applications (§3.5): membership applications with status IN (submitted, under_review, approved); rejected/cancelled release the slot. Read from enrollment-svc for the page; if enrollment-svc is unavailable the request fails (E-SYS-001) — the count never falls back to 0.
   */
